# Target code

```ts
console.log("matches");
console.error("matches too");
console.other("won't match");

```


# Query

```grit
`console.$method($message)` where {
    $method <: or { `log`, `info`, `warn`, `error` }
}

```


# Matches

1:1-1:23
console.log("matches");

2:1-2:29
console.error("matches too");


